===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|baseball}} An instance of an out created by touching a [[base]] in advance of a runner who has no base to return to while in possession of a [[ball]] which has already touched the ground.
#: ''A '''force out''' was recorded on the scorecard.''
